        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH100SCVSBR,  Bighorn \"S\" Curve Grip Brass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Brass S Door Pull is a stunning example of modern design that is not boxy. The free flowing movement of this Contemporary Wave Door Pull makes it a great accent for any contemporary space. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from a wide array of finishes.  Available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH04-specifications.gif?v=1704354659\" width=\"600\" height=\"222\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"First Impressions BGH100SCVSBR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BGH100012SCVSBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100024SCVSBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100036SCVSBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Brass S Door Pull | Contemporary Wave Door Pull",
                "description": "The Brass S Door Pull is a great choice for modern spaces from homes to offices. Buy the Contemporary Wave Door Pull in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths at Doorware.com today!",
